+///
+/// - Parameters:
+///  - input: A WebP format input stream.
+///
+/// - Throws:
+///  - `SignalError.ioError`: If an IO error on the input occurs.
+///  - `SignalError.invalidMediaInput` If the input could not be parsed because it was invalid.
